 "representation": "coding",
 "explanation": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "create_cache_key: serialise the call to one canonical string (type tags, objects with sorted keys), so equal calls give equal strings; an insertion-ordered map (OrderedDict / Map) gives O(1) LRU moves and evictions. Complexity target: O(size of the call) per call/O(capacity * key size) space.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk18-b-20261028-v1/design.json",
